=== RUN   TestAddCommandRequiresArguments
Usage:
  add <workflow>... [flags]

Examples:
  gh aw add githubnext/agentics/daily-repo-status        # Add workflow directly
  gh aw add githubnext/agentics/repo-assist              # Add package from repository root aw.yml
  gh aw add githubnext/agentics/packages/repo-assist     # Add package from nested aw.yml
  gh aw add githubnext/agentics/ci-doctor@v1.0.0         # Add with version
  gh aw add githubnext/agentics/workflows/ci-doctor.md@main
  gh aw add https://github.com/githubnext/agentics/blob/main/workflows/ci-doctor.md
  gh aw add https://example.com/my-workflow.md           # Add workflow from any HTTPS URL
  gh aw add https://example.com/workflow.json            # Import JSON workflow definition
  gh aw add githubnext/agentics/ci-doctor --create-pull-request --force
  gh aw add ./my-workflow.md                             # Add local workflow
  gh aw add ./*.md                                       # Add all local workflows
  gh aw add githubnext/agentics/ci-doctor --dir .github/workflows/shared   # Add to .github/workflows/shared/


Flags:
      --append string         Append extra content to the end of agentic workflow on installation
      --create-pull-request   Create a pull request with the workflow changes
  -d, --dir string            Workflow directory (default: .github/workflows)
  -e, --engine string         Override AI engine (copilot, claude, codex, gemini, crush)
  -f, --force                 Overwrite existing workflow files without confirmation
  -h, --help                  help for add
  -n, --name string           Specify name for the added workflow (without .md extension)
      --no-gitattributes      Skip updating .gitattributes file
      --no-security-scanner   Disable security scanning of workflow markdown content
      --no-stop-after         Remove any stop-after field from the workflow
      --stop-after string     Override stop-after value in the workflow (e.g., '+48h', '2025-12-31 23:59:59')

